# Lockdown mode service posture — sever radios and network services.
# NetworkManager controls the physical NICs, so stopping it (plus the
# nftables chain policy drop in lockdown.nft) is what actually cuts the
# machine off. Tor is stopped too — a degraded/partial tunnel in lockdown
# contradicts the mode's "no outbound" promise.
- NetworkManager
- tor@default
- nftables